# pstack model configuration

Provider-qualified per-role choices. Read the installed pstack provider-dispatch reference
before dispatching a configured role. Every documented role remains present. `inherit-parent`
and `auto` use the parent model natively and still count as one panel lane.

Rewritten by setup on 2026-09-02 for ai4good on pstack 1.2.1. Grok runs through the Grok
CLI. The DeepSeek and GLM opencode lanes are gone: pstack 1.2.1 has no route for them. The
decision record is `.claude/skills/work/pstack-model-selection.md` in the ai4good repository.

